// Effects quality (2026-10-07, user: "The effects are getting laggy... put a gfx setting in settings
// to turn off some of the effects? maybe Effects: None - Low - Med - High"). One level gates every
// decorative effect; gameplay feedback (damage numbers, hit flashes, deaths) always stays.
//   High — everything.   Medium — no idle breathing, heat haze, drag sparkles or lightning flicker.
//   Low — also no shaders, floating motes or match flourishes (shuffle, draw flip, parade, throne,
//         pixel reveal, page turn, feathers, shatter); 5 leaves on page changes.
//   None — also no page-change leaves and no ambient card shimmer anywhere.
