// -- same procedural approach, cool gunmetal palette, fine horizontal brushing + rivets + a
// diagonal specular sheen instead of wood grain) for Cave/Mountain-tagged cards -- the rock/
// mineral habitats (Stalactite Golem, Stoneheart Golem, the quarry-mole line) read naturally as
// "steely" grey stone rather than warm wood. No dedicated Metal/Construct archetype tag exists
// yet to key off of more literally; this is the closest real, already-tagged fit.
// 2026-09-25 (same day, follow-up: "cont" after being offered a list of further options): added
