  // correct line between true always-on Passive abilities and Evergreen abilities (a bundled
  // trigger+action shorthand, e.g. On Death: Spawn / Gash / Render / Earthquake / Inherent
  // Darkness) — see its own two separate panels — but the live editor's "+ Add Skill" section
  // still mixed both under one "Passive abilities" heading. Now split into two sections (see
  // the editor template below); each section's own key-picker only offers keys from its own
  // category, so a row can't silently jump between the two groups via its dropdown either.
  // mechLineGate (2026-09-27, item 5, "Design Lock"): a skill with a mechLineGate only shows up
  // as a PICKABLE option when the card's own Archetype (mechLine) matches — EXCEPT the row's
  // own currently-selected key always stays visible in its own dropdown (row.key===x.key), so
  // an existing card never has its already-set skill silently vanish out from under it just
  // because its Archetype doesn't match (or hasn't been picked yet).
  const gateOk = x => row.key===x.key || (!x.hidden && (!x.mechLineGate || x.mechLineGate===mechLine)); // hidden (2026-10-14): retired from "+ Add Skill" (Crab Claws)
  // 2026-10-16 (user: "Clean up the skill & action names. Don't put {} or 'one-off' or random comments inside."): Diurnal and the
  // old "Diurnal – { }" are one entry, "Diurnal"; the row's "Gives" field picks a stat bonus or a skill list (ZEIT_TWIN).
  const twinOf = ZEIT_TWIN[row.key] || ZEIT_TWIN_BACK[row.key];
