// Raid Points (2026-09-29, per explicit request: "Playing raids require both Raid points and
// energy. Add this new resource."): a second gate on Online Raid specifically, layered on TOP of
// the existing Energy cost (ENERGY_COST.onlineRaid) rather than replacing it — Energy already
// answers "can you afford to start any fight right now"; Raid Points answer "how many raid
// bosses can you meaningfully take on before you need to wait," a scarcer budget that regenerates
// far slower (hours, not minutes), matching a raid boss being the highest-stakes PvE content in
// the game. Lives inside myCurrencies (cloud-synced via player_currencies.raid_points) rather
// than its own localStorage key like Energy — Online Raid is already a signed-in, backend-driven
// feature, so this resource should follow a player across devices the same way gold/gems/dust/
// metal already do, not reset per-device the way Energy deliberately does.
const RAID_POINTS_MAX = 5;
