// a percentage of the map canvas, so the same layout logic works at any canvas width/map length
// without hardcoding per-map coordinates. Rows snake back and forth (odd rows run right-to-left)
// so the trail reads as one continuous path rather than a plain grid.
// Small deterministic string hash (FNV-1a) — used below purely to seed a stable per-node jitter,
// not for anything security-sensitive, so a simple 32-bit hash is plenty.
