  // outright on phones — see .hud-opponent-tag's mobile override) so it doesn't grow the bar, and it
  // reuses this row's existing "flex:1 spacer pushes the rest to the right" mechanism.
  // 2026-09-30, per explicit request ("Move the lumber and other resource counts down... top
  // banner"): .hud used to open the whole match screen, sitting directly above the OPPONENT's
  // castle/deck row (.top-play-row) purely because of DOM order — visually stranding "your"
  // resource pills right next to the enemy's stuff instead of your own. Moved the whole block
  // down to sit directly above .bottom-play-row (your own castle/deck/hand) instead, right where
